"Queueing an identical action MERGES its targets into the earliest queued instance instead of replacing it. Mergeability is a u8 mergeableEndedStepIndex — the step past which a running action stops absorbing merges: 0 for most actions; equip/unequip/take merge right up until completion so several items resolve in one action. Alternative, possibly simpler: make equip/unequip/take instantaneous actions that skip the queue and resolve outside the normal action system, for responsiveness."